  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omulawi no mukhasi wewe niye akhaakhwa tawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ndaalo echo Isiraeli ne ekhaba no mwami tawe abao omulawi owaba omukwa mu sibala sie bikulu sia Efuraimu. Aabukula omukhaana khukhwama e Betelehemu mu Yuda abe omukhasi niye aamenyia busa nga omusaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi oyo aaloba omulawi oyo mala aakobola munju eya raraawe e Betelehemu, amenyayo kimieesi kine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omuseecha wewe amuloondakho khu musaaya akobole naye. Omundu oyo acha ne omukholi wewe ne chipunda chibili. Eecha munju eya paapa owo mukhasi wewe ne nga paapa owo mukhaana oyo ne abona omulawi oyo, amwakaanila ne busangaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paapa owo mukhaana oyo amusaba abeekhoo khu siise mala abao khu ndaalo chitaru. Nio ne balia, ne banywa ne khukonayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumutikhinyi kwe ndaalo ekhola khane benyokha makhelebeende mala berekekha khurekukha bache. Ne kakhali paapa owo mukhaana aboolela omulawi oyo ali, “Liakho sisiindu nio muche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio lundi babaandu babili abo, paapa owo mukhaana no mulawi, bekhala asi mala balia, banywa alala. Nio paapa owo mukhaana aboolela mulawi ali, “Nosiima kona eno mala kumwoyo kwowo kusangaale.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulawi enyokha ali arekukhe, mala paapa owo omukhasi amusaba akone. Nio akonayo siilo sisiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaalo ekhola kharaano, Omulawi enyokha kumutikhinyi makhelebeende ali arekukhe, ne kakhali paapa owo omukhaana aloma ali, “Nosiima liakho sisiindu mala oliinde khukhwola ekolooba.” Nio babaandu babili abo, paapa owo mukhaana ne omulawi baliila alala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga omundu oyo no mukhasi wewe no mukholi berekekha khurekukha, paapa owo mukhaana aboolela omulawi ali, “Lola, bwelabuule, nosiima kona lundi silo sino. Sisiilima silikho siamba, kona ano mala ouluukhe. Kumutikhinyi onyala wenyokha makhelebeende oche engo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali omulawi oyo se enya khukonayo siilo sisiindi tawe, nio niye no mukhasi wewe barakikha lukeendo lwabwe. Baba ne chipunda chibili ne chilikho khale bibiindu bie khwikhala kho mu mikoongo kiacho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaba oli ekolooba enje ne elikho etiimba, bola siimbi e Yebusi (nilwo lukoba lwa Yerusalemu). Nio omukholi aaboolela omwami wewe ali, “Lekha khwingile mu lukoba luno lwe Bayebusi mala khukonemo silo sino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali omwami wewe aloma ali, “Se khulikho khucha khwima khwingile mu lukoba lwe bareende, babaandu bakhali Baisiraeli tawe. Khulabira khwole Kibea.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aaboolela omukholi wewe ali, “Yiicha khubire mala khuchekho ebweeni nio khukonele e Kibea namwe Rama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babira e Yebusi mala bachiililila ne lukeendo lwabwe. Enyanga beele yakwile nga boola Kibea mu sibala sie ekholo eya Babenjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baacha bakone mu lukoba omwo siilo esio. Bacha mu lukoba mala bekhala akari we lukoba sikila se abao omundu yesi yesi owababukula bache bakone munju mwewe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne baba abwenao omusaakhulu echa niio bali khukhwama khu milimo kiewe mu mukuunda. Omusaakhulu yuno ama mu sibala sie bikulu sia Efuraimu, aaba omukwa mu Kibea. (Babaandu be abwenao baba be ekholo eya Benjamini.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaakhulu oyo aabona omukeni akari we lukoba mala amureeba ali, “Ewe wama waena? Ne olikho ocha waena?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulawi amukobosia ali, “Khwama e Betelehemu mu Yuda. Khuli khu lukeendo lwefwe khucha engo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "khucha engo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "likaluukhasia lilala lie khaale liakaluukhasibwa lili khucha engo; Lueburania luli khucha munju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mu sibala sie bikulu sia Efuraimu. Nacha e Betelehemu mu Yuda, ne luno ndikho nja engo wase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbao omundu oumbukuule nje ngone munju mwewe tawe. Khuli ne siakhulia ne bunyaasi bwe chipunda, kumukaati ne endali bio mukhasi wase ne nase ne omukholi wase yesi. Khuli nende buli siindu nisio khwenya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaakhulu oyo aloma ali, “Ese namwakaaniile mukone mungo mwase! Ndamuliinda, mukhakona enje mu lukoba tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio abayila mu mwewe, mala aliisia chipunda chabwe. Bakeni bewe besiinga bikele mala balia ne khuunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
